<newsitem itemid="50803" id="root" date="1996-09-12" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Logica boosts year profits 22 percent.</title>
<headline>Logica boosts year profits 22 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		27.1		   vs 21.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.8		    vs 6.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     24.7		   vs 20.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   284.8		  vs 250.1</p>
<p>NOTE - UK software group Logica Plc said the results were a record and noted that it expected further good revenue growth in the current year. The company said it believed Logica would take a &quot;further step&quot; towards its 10 percent margin targets.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 23.64		  vs 19.41</p>
<p> Interest		   0.55		   vs 0.48</p>
<p> Tax charge		 8.13		   vs 7.16</p>
<p> Net taxed		  16.58		  vs 13.15</p>
<p> Retained earnings	11.76		  vs 9.35</p>
<p> Pay date		   Nov 14</p>
<p>Div registration date  Oct 1  Ex-div date		Sept 23</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7972</p>
</text>
